Initial release: July 3-15, 2013

Bigby's Handy Box is a limited time offer Store item . Notably, it includes a level 15 [[Stone of Experience]] and [[Gelatinous Cube]] [[Creature Companion]]. Freely tradable for gift use.

=== Bigby's Handy Box ===
* {{Item|Stone of Experience}}
* {{Item|Sovereign I Experience Elixir|3 Sovereign I Experience Elixirs}}
* {{Item|Siberys_Spirit_Cake#Siberys_Spirit_Cake|5 Siberys Spirit Cakes}}
* A choice of either {{Item|Gold Seal Elixir of Sovereign Healing|100 Gold Seal Elixirs of Sovereign Healing}} (BtA) or {{Item|Concentrated Elixir of Superior Mnemonic Enhancement|25 Concentrated Elixirs of Superior Mnemonic Enhancement}} (BtA), or a [[Red Gelatinous Cube-let]] creature companion.
All of the consumables are Bound to Account. The {{Item|Stone of Experience}} has special use limitations, see [[Stone of Experience| here]] for more information.

